(Japanese: '''プロローグマサラタウン''' ''Prologue: {{tt|Masara|Pallet}} Town'') is the prologue chapter of the [[Pokémon Zensho]] manga.

==Plot==
While searching around for his first Pokémon, {{Zensho|Satoshi}} is attacked by a flock of {{p|Pidgey}}. [[Professor Oak]] and his {{p|Charmander}} intervene, burning one of the Pidgey and scaring the rest away.

Prof. Oak takes Satoshi to his lab, where Oak's anxious grandson and Satoshi's [[rival]] {{Zensho|Shigeru}} waits. Oak shows Satoshi three {{i|Poké Ball}}s, and tells him to choose one of three [[first partner Pokémon]]: {{p|Squirtle}}, {{p|Bulbasaur}}, or Charmander. Satoshi chooses the {{Zensho|Satoshi's Charmander|Charmander}} which had saved him earlier, so Shigeru chooses Squirtle and Oak keeps the {{p|Bulbasaur}}.

Shigeru challenges Satoshi to a battle. Charmander attacks, but it's ineffective against Shigeru's Squirtle. Squirtle shoots water out of its mouth while Charmander dodges. Then Satoshi orders Charmander to {{m|tackle}} which instantly wins the battle. While Satoshi cheers his first victory, Prof. Oak gives Shigeru and Satoshi [[Pokédex]]es, and explains to them what the Pokédex does.

==Major events==
* {{Zensho|Satoshi}} starts his Pokémon journey with his [[first partner Pokémon]], {{Zensho|Satoshi's Charmander|Charmander}}.

